@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="legal-page">

    <div class="legal-header">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: @DateTime.Now.ToString("d MMMM yyyy")</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-notice">
        <i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill"></i>
        <p>
            Umbilo Rentals is currently operated as a student project. We still aim to
            handle your information responsibly and in line with South Africa's
            Protection of Personal Information Act, 2013 (POPIA).
        </p>
    </div>

    <section>
        <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
        <p>
            Umbilo Rentals ("we", "us") operates this platform to help students in
            Umbilo, Durban find and apply for accommodation. For any privacy-related
            question, contact us at
            <a href="mailto:info@umbilorentals.co.za">info@umbilorentals.co.za</a>.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
        <p>We only collect information needed to run the platform:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Account details</strong> — name, email address and phone number when you register.</li>
            <li><strong>Application documents</strong> — supporting documents you choose to upload (for example proof of ID or enrolment) when applying for a room.</li>
            <li><strong>Accommodation data</strong> — the rooms you apply for, application status, and move-in/move-out records.</li>
            <li><strong>Maintenance requests</strong> — details you submit when reporting a maintenance issue.</li>
            <li><strong>Payment references</strong> — we record that a payment was made and its status. We do not collect or store your card or bank details; these are handled directly by our payment processor, PayFast.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not request more information than is necessary for these purposes.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>3. How we use your information</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>To create and manage your account.</li>
            <li>To process room applications and communicate their status.</li>
            <li>To process payments through PayFast and reflect payment status on your dashboard.</li>
            <li>To manage maintenance requests.</li>
            <li>To send you notifications about your account, application or accommodation.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not use it for advertising.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>4. Third parties we share information with</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <strong>PayFast (Pty) Ltd</strong> — a licensed South African payment
                gateway used to process rental payments. PayFast handles your payment
                details directly; we only receive confirmation of payment status.
            </li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not share your information with advertisers or data brokers.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
            This site uses only the session cookie required to keep you logged in.
            See our <a href="@Url.Action("Cookies", "Legal")">Cookie Policy</a> for details.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>6. Data retention</h2>
        <p>
            We keep your account and application information for as long as your
            account is active, and for a reasonable period afterwards in case you
            reapply or query a past application. You can request deletion of your
            account data at any time (see your rights below).
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>7. Your rights under POPIA</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Ask us what personal information we hold about you.</li>
            <li>Ask us to correct inaccurate information.</li>
            <li>Ask us to delete your information, subject to any legal obligation to keep records.</li>
            <li>Object to how we process your information.</li>
            <li>Withdraw consent you previously gave us, where processing is based on consent.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            To exercise any of these rights, email
            <a href="mailto:info@umbilorentals.co.za">info@umbilorentals.co.za</a>.
            You may also lodge a complaint with South Africa's Information Regulator
            (<a href="https://inforegulator.org.za" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">inforegulator.org.za</a>).
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>8. Security</h2>
        <p>
            We take reasonable technical steps to protect your information. However,
            because this platform is a student project, no online system can be
            guaranteed 100% secure, and we recommend not uploading documents
            containing information beyond what an application form requests.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
            We may update this policy from time to time. The "last updated" date at
            the top of this page will reflect the most recent change.
        </p>
    </section>

</div>
